          "display_name": "Assistant",
          "participant_id": "builtin-assistant",
          "text": "Writer\u2019s saved default is indeed OpenAI: **openai-direct**, using **gpt-5.4-mini**.\n\nThe likely explanation is a **session-only Model override in S1**. The chat toolbar can select a different provider for Writer in that session without changing Writer\u2019s Character settings.\n\nOpen **S1**, select **Writer**, and check the toolbar\u2019s **Model**:\n- If it shows Gemini, that explains the difference.\n- Choose **Default** to use Writer\u2019s saved OpenAI provider again.\n\nI can\u2019t read session overrides with my maintenance tools, and the logs I checked didn\u2019t establish which provider answered in S1. What does its Model control show?\n\nWriter also has a folder reference named **Docs Gemini**, but that reference does **not** switch its answering model to Gemini.",
